### 1. `design-rules/deterministic/generated/det-diagram-labels.check.js`
Replaced the auto-generated stub with a full check that:

- **Repo scan** (`scanRepoDiagramLabels`): For each `generator/pages/_diagram_gallery.py` key, reads `js/ks-diagram-catalog.js` legend `items[].node` values and compares them to `<text>` / `<tspan>` content in the matching `assets/svg/template-*.svg`.
