- **Pass criteria**: At least `max(2, ceil(50% × legendCount))` legend node strings must appear in readable diagram text (constants: `MIN_LEGEND_NODE_MATCHES`, `LEGEND_COVERAGE_RATIO`).
- **Violation kinds**:
  - `diagram-labels-no-readable-text` — no usable labels in SVG/ASCII
